# Requirements Done check

When editing files under `Requirements/`:

- Do not tick `Done` (or update the progress table) until the story is verified.
- Verification means unit tests for the work **and** a visual check of the screen.
- Leave the checkbox empty if tests failed, the UI was not checked, or the story is only partially done.
- CI enforces the test half: `scripts/validate-tests.py` fails the PR if you add a `[x]` Done checkbox without also changing `URBNFlicksTests/`. The screenshot remains a human/PR-template check.
